<title>UK: Merrill leads $506 million FRN for MLCC Mortgage.</title>
<headline>Merrill leads $506 million FRN for MLCC Mortgage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following Mortgage Loan Asset Backed Pass-Through Certificates were announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MLCC MORTGAGE INVESTORS INC 1996-D</p>
<p> AMT  $506,359,000    BASE	 1M-LIBOR  LEG MAT	  FEB.25</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  MARGIN   **30 BP     EXP MAT	  MAR.10</p>
<p> ISSUE	*	   REOFFER     *	  PAY DATE ***1O.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    MONTHLY</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     **INDICATED COUPON AREA ONLY.</p>
<p>	    ***PLUS 25 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
